  "name": "luh-supplementary-dataset-sensitivity-analysis-for-parameter-prioritization-in-factory-operations",
  "notes": "This dataset documents the reduced multi-criteria factory operations model and the sensitivity analysis results used in the accompanying GCSM 2026 conference paper. It contains: (i) the complete list of 51 active input parameters with baseline values, perturbation bounds, units and source references; (ii) four output KPI definitions; (iii) the main aggregation equations of the factory operations model; (iv) the configuration of the three sensitivity analysis approaches (OAT, Morris, Sobol); and (v) the resulting normalised and non-normalised sensitivity indices for all parameters and KPIs.\r\n\r\nThis dataset is published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0). Reuse is permitted provided that appropriate credit is given to the authors and the associated paper/dataset is cited.",
